  "Qty 61 as published; the author's update says 'this deck was one card over, take out something to make it 60 cards, not sure what'.",
  "The 'Starting (10)' block repeats cards that are also listed in their sections (There Is Good In Him, Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout, Luke's Lightsaber, Endor: Chief Chirpa's Hut, Endor Docking Bay, I Feel The Conflict, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Draw Their Fire, Staging Areas, Insurrection), so it is not counted again; the section lists total 61. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Endor Docking Bay' dested Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'Hoth Docking Bay' Hoth: Echo Docking Bay; 'EPP Leia' Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'EPP Han' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'EPP Obi' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'Lando in Falcon' Lando In Millennium Falcon; 'Yarna' (under Effects) the Jabba's Palace Effect Yarna d'al' Gargan.",
